---
title: Memory Gateway - basic auto, full on /set-context
---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant PI as PI runtime
  participant Ext as Memory Extension
  participant GCfg as ~/.pi/memory/config.toml
  participant Sent as .memory/config.toml
  participant Vault as 80_AI/ Vault
  participant LLM

  rect rgb(245,245,250)
    Note over PI,LLM: Session start - cheap, auto, basic context
    PI->>Ext: session_start
    Ext->>GCfg: load global config
    Ext->>Sent: load sentinel state
    Ext->>Vault: stat .last_dream.marker
    Note over Ext: build basic block:<br/>repo, project, plan, domains, dream status
    Ext->>PI: append memory-gateway entry
    PI->>Ext: before_agent_start
    Ext->>PI: return systemPrompt + gateway
    PI->>LLM: chat with basic memory state
  end

  Note over User: User wants full memory awareness

  rect rgb(245,250,245)
    Note over User,LLM: /set-context - manual, full gateway
    User->>PI: /set-context [project[/plan]]
    PI->>Ext: handler invoked

    alt args provided
      Ext->>Sent: update project/plan state
    end

    alt path was / or ~
      Ext->>Sent: clear state
      Note over Ext: revert to basic - no active project
    else
      Ext->>Vault: read project.md
      Ext->>Vault: read last N lines of notes.md
      Ext->>Vault: read active plan.md
      Ext->>Vault: read active domain pages
      Note over Ext: assemble full gateway within token budget
      Ext->>PI: append full memory-gateway entry
      PI->>LLM: next turn includes full gateway
    end

    Ext-->>User: context loaded - project, plan, domains
  end

  Note over User,LLM: Re-run /set-context to refresh after external edits.
